diagram flow "Order flow"

Order placed [start]
Paid? [decision]
Ask for payment [io, table: shop.payments]
Handed over [end]

Kitchen {
  Cook [step, color: warning]
  Packing {
    Pack order [subprocess]
    Label bag
  }
}

// a chain and every flowchart arrow
Order placed > Paid?
Paid? > Cook: yes
Paid? > Ask for payment: no
Ask for payment --> Paid?
Cook > Pack order > Label bag
Label bag - Handed over
Kitchen <> Ask for payment: questions
